<title>SWITZERLAND: Holderbank reports lower interim profit.</title>
<headline>Holderbank reports lower interim profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		     (in million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			283	vs	 306</p>
<p> Turnover		     4,481	vs     3,938</p>
<p>Note - Full name of Swiss cement producer is Holderbank Financiere Glarus AG.  </p>
<p> Operating profit		  494	vs    546</p>
<p> Net per bearer		  30.50    vs    38.85</p>
<p> Volume figures</p>
<p> Cement and clinker</p>
<p> deliveries  (tonnes)	  28.3 million* vs   24.6 million</p>
<p> Sales of aggerates (tonnes) 33.1 million  vs   34.3 million</p>
<p> Sales of ready-mixed</p>
<p> concrete (cubic metres)     8.5  million  vs   8.2 million</p>
<p>*Company said changes in the scope of consolidation accounted for 2.8 million tonnes of 15.1 percent increase.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
